flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Breach the facility, weaken the satellite&#39;s supports, and collapse the dish structure."])
 _A1_(["The team emerges from the forest, sticking to the edge of the cliff."])
 _A1_1_(["They take up position behind a ridge as Engineer creeps over."])
 _A1_2_(["Engineer spots a motion-sensor floodlight covering their proposed entry point."])
 _A1_3_(["Edging along the narrow ledge, Engineer reaches the service junction box."])
 _A1_C1_{"Engineer pulls out his wire cutters and tries to access the junction through the fence."}
 _A1_C1F_["Engineer cuts a wire, but the indicator light on the sensor continues to blink."]
 _A1_C2_{"Engineer reaches through once more and tries to deactivate the sensor."}
 _A1_C2P_["With a snip, the indicator light goes dead as multiple sensor lights are rendered inactive."]
 _A2_(["Engineer sidesteps back along the narrow ridge and gestures for the others to approach."])
 _A2_1_(["Muscle cuts open the fence with the bolt cutters and pulls a section to one side."])
 _A2_2_(["One by one, the team enters the facility, hiding behind a nearby utility cabin."])
 _A2_3_(["Assassin eyes the kennels, creeping over carefully to avoid any sensors still active."])
 _A2_C1_{"Assassin tries to poison the guard dogs’ water supply before the patrol returns."}
 _A2_C1P_["A small measure of ipecac is dispensed into the water bowls."]
 _A3_(["Assassin escapes the kennels just as the patrol returns."])
 _A3_1_(["The dogs lap greedily from the water bowls and immediately start puking their guts out."])
 _A3_2_(["With the patrol halted, the team sneaks eastward to the first support strut."])
 _A3_C1_{"Saboteur #1 identifies the weak spot and tries to secure the thermite to the strut."}
 _A3_C1P_["The thermite cuts through the steel cleanly, the strut buckling without collapsing."]
 _A4_(["The noise draws over one of the guards, forcing the team into hiding."])
 _A4_C1_{"As the guard’s flashlight passes over the damaged strut, Muscle moves in for the kill."}
 _A4_C1F_["Muscle grabs the guard from behind but fails to make a killing move."]
 _A4_C2_{"Assassin rushes to help Muscle take down the guard."}
 _A4_C2P_["Assassin smothers the guard&#39;s cries and Muscle strikes him hard in the throat."]
 _A5_(["Muscle helps Assassin drag the body out of sight."])
 _A5_1_(["The team creeps over to the second support strut, sticking to the shadows."])
 _A5_2_(["Engineer’s observations suggest this strut must be cut at a higher point."])
 _A5_C1_{"Saboteur #2 climbs up high into position to set the thermite."}
 _A5_C1P_["The strut glows red hot as the thermite eats through the steel in no time."]
 _A6_(["A deep groan rolls through the structure as the strut bends under the redistributed load."])
 _A6_1_(["With the supports weakened, the team heads to the control room to complete the mission."])
 _A6_C1_{"Muscle bursts in brandishing the bolt cutters to intimidate the technicians."}
 _A6_C1P_["One technician refuses to back down, so Muscle batters her head in with the tool."]
 _A7_(["The others back down and the team kettles them into a supply closet."])
 _A7_1_(["With the room cleared, Engineer approaches the antenna control console."])
 _A7_C1_{"Engineer tries to move the dish to redistribute its weight onto the weakened side."}
 _A7_C1F_["Engineer inadvertently moves the satellite upward, leaving the structure intact."]
 _A7_2_(["Saboteur #1 notices a team of guards approaching the control room."])
 _A7_C2_{"Assassin and Muscle hold the doors shut while Engineer moves the dish."}
 _A7_C2P_["Engineer moves the antenna eastward, causing the dish to shear free of the struts."]
 _A8_1_(["Assassin and Muscle keep the guards occupied while the others escape."])
 _A8S2_(["The three teammates make it out of the facility as security surrounds those left behind."])
 _A1_C2F_["A jolt of electricity causes Engineer to slip down, his fall broken by a branch."]
 _A1_C3_{"Saboteur #1 rushes over to help Engineer."}
 _A1_C3P_["Saboteur #1 drags Engineer up, allowing him to finally deactivate the motion sensors."]
 _A1_5_(["Grabbing onto the fence, the pair edge back across the ridge and gesture to the others."])
 _A4_C1P_["The guard’s life is snuffed out with a swift neck snap."]
 _A7_C1P_["As the antenna turns east, the damaged struts fail, and the whole dish collapses."]
 _A8_(["The team spills out of the control room and makes a break for the south-east fenceline."])
 _A8S_(["While the guards gather at the cliff to gawk at the spectacle, the team escapes the facility."])
 _A1_C1P_["Reaching through, Engineer pulls open the panel and cuts power to a section of floodlights."]
 _A5_C1F_["The thermite burns the outer layer of the strut but fails to penetrate the structure."]
 _A5_3_(["Saboteur #1 mocks Saboteur #2&#39;s attempt and slaps him in the face."])
 _A5_4_(["Out of thermite, the crew looks around for another way to damage the strut."])
 _B5_1_(["Engineer investigates a service building and finds a hydraulic bolt extractor."])
 _B5_C1_{"Saboteur #1 and Engineer try to compromise the strut by removing several bolts."}
 _B5_C1P_["With the fasteners gone, the strut settles into a dangerous misalignment."]
 _B6_(["The team moves on toward the control cabin to complete the final stage of the mission."])
 _B6_1_(["A patrol is encountered by the cabin, forcing them to retreat."])
 _B6_2_(["Muscle finds a telehandler and jumps aboard, determined to complete the mission."])
 _B6_C1_{"Muscle tries to ram one of the support struts and force the dish to collapse."}
 _B6_C1F_["Muscle smashes into the strut but it remains intact."]
 _B6_3_(["Security swarms the vehicle and drags Muscle from the telehandler."])
 _B6_C2_{"The whole team assaults the guards in a desperate attempt to finish the mission."}
 _B6_C2F_["Assassin, Muscle, and Saboteur #2 are brutalized, prompting the others to retreat."]
 _B6F_(["Multiple rounds are pumped into Saboteur #1 and Engineer, ending their escape attempt."])
 _A6_C1F_["The nerds fight back valiantly, dogpiling Muscle and almost overwhelming him."]
 _A6_C2_{"Assassin rushes in to aid Muscle and beat the technicians down."}
 _A6_C2P_["Assassin grabs a technician, snatches a pencil, and smashes it hard into her nostril."]
 _A2_C1F_["Assassin strays too close to an active sensor, forcing her to back off."]
 _A2_C2_{"Once the light goes out, Assassin sneaks over for another attempt."}
 _A2_C2P_["Assassin dispenses a small amount of ipecac into both dogs&#39; water bowls."]
 _A4_C2F_["The guard evades Assassin&#39;s grasp and screams out for help."]
 _A4_1_(["With the alarm raised, the entire facility&#39;s security team descends upon the crew."])
 _A4F_(["Surrounded and subdued, the team gives up, their sabotage attempt cut off at the knees."])
 _A3_C1F_["The charge won’t stick to the strut’s load point, forcing Saboteur #1 to reassess."]
 _A3_C2_{"Saboteur #1 reseats the charge in a fresh location, hoping it will hold."}
 _A3_C2F_["The thermite burns out cleanly but the strut holds, its surface tarnished by the heat."]
 _B3_(["Saboteur #2 curses Saboteur #1 for wasting thermite and offers up his own supply."])
 _B3_C1_{"Saboteur #1 and Saboteur #2 try to apply the fresh thermite charge to the steel strut."}
 _B3_C1F_["Saboteur #2 aborts just before ignition, having noticed the charge has dislodged."]
 _B3_C2_{"Saboteur #1 realigns the charge according to Saboteur #2&#39;s instructions and prepares to ignite."}
 _B3_C2P_["The thermite slices through the steel strut in no time, much to the team&#39;s delight."]
 _B4_(["Having used all their thermite, the team scouts the facility for alternative options."])
 _B4_1_(["They are stopped in their tracks by the presence of a lone guard patrolling nearby."])
 _B4_C1_{"Assassin and Muscle work together to double-team the guard quietly."}
 _B4_C1P_["Assassin distracts the guard and Muscle caves her face in with the bolt cutters."]
 _B5_(["The guard&#39;s body is dragged away and hidden discreetly."])
 _B6_C2P_["A vicious fight erupts, occupying security while Engineer boards the telehandler."]
 _B7_2_(["While the others brawl, Engineer rams the vehicle hard into the strut."])
 _B7_3_(["The satellite sags instantly, prompting everyone to scatter."])
 _B7_4_(["Engineer and Saboteur #1 are caught in the wreckage as the structure collapses."])
 _B7S2_(["The remaining teammates dash for the fence, their destructive message broadcast far and wide."])
 _A3_C2P_["The thermite burns fast and true, eating through the steel to compromise the strut."]
 _B6_C1P_["The strut buckles on impact and the satellite dish supports begin to crumple."]
 _B7_(["Muscle tries to reverse but is crushed by the collapsing structure."])
 _B7_1_(["The others use the spectacle to cover their escape as the guards watch on in awe."])
 _B7S_(["One teammate light, the crew bolts for the fence, leaving destruction in their wake."])
 _A7_C2F_["Assassin and Muscle are overwhelmed, and the guards rush the room."]
 _A7_3_(["Saboteur #1 and Saboteur #2 barricade the control room door, buying more time."])
 _A7_C3_{"Engineer makes one final attempt to move the dish as the others brace the door."}
 _A7_C3P_["Engineer moves the dish eastward and the whole structure collapses."]
 _A8_2_(["The guards burst through and apprehend the whole team, but they are too late."])
 _A8S3_(["The crew is charged with domestic terrorism, their sabotage task failed successfully."])
 _B5_C1F_["Two bolts are removed but the strut remains fixed firmly to the ground."]
 _B5_C2_{"Saboteur #2 takes the extractor and tries to help Engineer."}
 _B5_C2P_["The bolts come free and the strut slips, its integrity visibly compromised."]
 _B3_C1P_["The compound burns through the strut, the steel groaning as the load shifts."]
 _A2_C2F_["Assassin pours too much ipecac into one bowl and tries to balance it out."]
 _A2_4_(["As Assassin clumsily decants one bowl&#39;s contents into another, the patrol approaches."])
 _A2_5_(["The dogs catch Assassin and rip him to shreds as the guards watch on."])
 _A2F_(["The rest of the crew flees through the fence, having made a real dog&#39;s dinner of the mission."])
 _A6_C2F_["Summoning immense courage, the technicians hold off the attackers, forcing them outside."]
 _A6_2_(["With the alarm raised, the team has to think on their feet."])
 _B5_C2F_["One bolt is removed but Saboteur #2 binds the extractor on a jammed head."]
 _B5_C3_{"Saboteur #2 tries to wrestle the extractor free and cut the final bolt with the bolt cutters."}
 _B5_C3P_["The last bolt is sheared and removed, causing the strut to buckle, the dish ready to collapse."]
 _B5_C3F_["The extractor remains stuck, and the team is caught arguing by the approaching patrol."]
 _B5_2_(["As the guards give chase, the team is driven toward the fence."])
 _B5_3_(["The motion sensor light flicks on and illuminates the crew, revealing their position."])
 _B5F_(["Saboteur #2 and Engineer are shot in the back as the others escape through the fence."])
 _A7_C3F_["The guards crash through the door before Engineer can get the dish into position."]
 _A7F_(["The entire crew is caught like dogs, their sabotage efforts thwarted just in time."])
 _B4_C1F_["The guard spots the pair coming and boots Assassin in the gut, temporarily winding her."]
 _B4_C2_{"Muscle tries to take the guard down alone."}
 _B4_C2F_["The guard manages to disarm Muscle and knock him out with his own bolt cutters."]
 _B4_2_(["Saboteur #1 and Saboteur #2 run over to help but it&#39;s too late, as more guards arrive."])
 _B4_3_(["Saboteur #1 and Saboteur #2 are taken out with rapid shots to the head."])
 _B4F_(["Surrounded by armed security, the others raise their hands and give up."])
 _B4_C2P_["Muscle jabs the guard&#39;s throat with the bolt cutters, choking her out."]
 _B3_C2F_["Yet again, the attempt fails, the steel strut remaining strong as ever."]
 _B3_1_(["One of the guards is drawn over by the noise and catches the team loitering by the strut."])
 _B3_2_(["The guard opens fire, wounding Saboteur #1 as the crew rushes toward the fence."])
 _B3_3_(["Assassin and Saboteur #2 are cut down by the second guard as he intercepts them."])
 _B3F_(["The others dash out across the grass to the safety of the forest, leaving their teammates behind."])
 _A1_C3F_["Unknown"]

